            </table>
            <p>{{ modelDocking.md.note }}</p>

            <figure style="margin:1.5rem 0; text-align:center;">
              <img src="../static/image/dry-lab/model/model-fig-1-7-rmsd-cluster5.png" alt="Figure 7. Backbone RMSD of the R1aB6–H1N1 HA complex (Cluster 5) over the 100 ns simulation; the dashed line marks the 90–100 ns mean of 0.4574 nm" loading="lazy" width="2967" height="1466" style="max-width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid #ddd;">
              <figcaption style="margin-top:.5rem; color:#666; font-size:.9rem;">Figure 7. Backbone RMSD of the R1aB6&ndash;H1N1 HA complex (Cluster 5): the trajectory stabilises after the first ~10 ns, with a 90&ndash;100 ns mean of 0.4574 nm (computational prediction results)</figcaption>
