            </figure>

            <h3 id="model-mmgbsa">1.8 gmx_MMPBSA Binding Free Energy</h3>
            <p>MM-GBSA calculations were performed using the single-trajectory protocol implemented in
              {{ modelDocking.mmgbsa.engine }}, with the {{ modelDocking.mmgbsa.forcefield }} force field for the
              binding free energy estimation, for both clusters of the refined complex:</p>
            <table style="{{ modelDocking.tableStyle.table }}">
