            <h3 id="model-positive-control">1.9 Positive Control: 9VH4 Re-docking</h3>
            <p>The experimentally resolved 9VH4 complex (H1N1 HA with its co-crystallised antibody) was re-docked
              through the same HADDOCK pipeline as a positive control for the docking protocol:</p>
            <table style="{{ modelDocking.tableStyle.table }}">
              <thead>
                <tr style="{{ modelDocking.tableStyle.headRow }}">
                  <th style="{{ modelDocking.tableStyle.th }}">Metric</th>
                  <th style="{{ modelDocking.tableStyle.th }}">Result</th>
                </tr>
