                  <td style="{{ modelDocking.tableStyle.td }}">{{ row.metric }}</td>
                  <td style="{{ modelDocking.tableStyle.td }}">{{ row.value }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              </tbody>
            </table>
            <p>The near-complete cluster convergence (199 structures, 99%) and the low interface i-RMSD (2.113 &Aring;)
              indicate that the pipeline reproduces a known binding mode. This validates the docking protocol; it does
              not validate any candidate, and it is not an experimental measurement of the project's own complex.</p>

