              <figcaption style="margin-top:.5rem; color:#666; font-size:.9rem;">Figure 12. i-RMSD evidence from the positive-control re-docking (computational validation of the protocol)</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <figure style="margin:1.5rem 0; text-align:center;">
              <img src="../static/image/dry-lab/model/model-fig-1-9-superposition.png" alt="Figure 13. Superposition of the re-docked positive-control complex onto the experimental 9VH4 complex" loading="lazy" width="1029" height="772" style="max-width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid #ddd;">
              <figcaption style="margin-top:.5rem; color:#666; font-size:.9rem;">Figure 13. Superposition diagram of the positive-control re-docking (computational validation of the protocol)</figcaption>
            </figure>

